# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is git-ignored; this file is tracked and holds no values.
# Any variable with a public prefix (EXPO_PUBLIC_, NEXT_PUBLIC_, VITE_, ...) is bundled
# into the client and is public: never put a service-role key or any other secret there.
# Secrets never appear in commands, files, or chat; the owner adds them here by hand.

# TBD: one block per variable: name, what it is, where to get it, an example shape (not a value)
